<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ecolab raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ecolab raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating on Ecolab Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 3/4 to 38 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately to comment.</p>
</text>
